{"id":59219,"date":"2026-08-13T07:35:33","date_gmt":"2026-08-13T06:35:33","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-09-01T18:57:59","modified_gmt":"2026-09-01T17:57:59","slug":"last-man-n-s-dos-remedios","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/last-man-n-s-dos-remedios\/","title":{"rendered":"Last Man &#8211; N. S. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 1 - DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre O <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Last Man &#8211; N. S. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>1\u00ba Last Man \u2013 N. Sra. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>5 de setembro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado)<\/strong>, na cidade de <strong>Lamego<\/strong> (distrito de Viseu). Organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Lamaecus D\u2019Ouro em parceria com a Irmandade de N. Sra. dos Rem\u00e9dios e a Freguesia de Lamego, este desafio in\u00e9dito introduz o formato de elimina\u00e7\u00e3o progressiva (Last Man Standing) no ic\u00f3nico cen\u00e1rio monumental da cidade.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com arranque da 1\u00aa volta agendado para as <strong>18:00<\/strong> no Escad\u00f3rio da N. Sra. dos Rem\u00e9dios (secretariado a partir das 16:30), os participantes enfrentam um circuito de <strong>3,5 km com 150m D+<\/strong>. O tempo limite da 1\u00aa volta \u00e9 de 33 minutos, sendo reduzido em 2 minutos a cada volta consecutiva. Se pretende planear o seu calend\u00e1rio na regi\u00e3o norte e centro, consulte o nosso <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-viseu\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas em Viseu<\/a> ou explore os nossos <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calendario-de-corridas\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">guias de provas de trail e resist\u00eancia<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o (12\u20ac) \u00e9 limitada a 100 participantes e inclui dorsal, seguro de acidentes pessoais, medalha finisher, abastecimentos e balne\u00e1rios. Por ser uma prova noturna em escad\u00f3rios e trilhos, a utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o de lanterna frontal e recipiente pr\u00f3prio para l\u00edquidos \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3ria.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 2 - FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 18:00 (Secretariado a partir das 16:30)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Lamego, Viseu<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Circuito de 3,5 km (150m D+) em elimina\u00e7\u00f5es progressivas (Last Man Standing)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Lamaecus D\u2019Ouro, Irmandade Sra. dos Rem\u00e9dios e Freguesia de Lamego<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Elimina\u00e7\u00e3o a cada volta (redu\u00e7\u00e3o de 2 minutos por volta a partir de 33 min na 1\u00aa volta)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Abastecimentos<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Abastecimentos l\u00edquidos na zona de in\u00edcio\/fim do circuito (trazer recipiente individual)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 3 - GEOMETRIA & PERCURSO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Percurso<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso do <strong>Last Man \u2013 N. Sra. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 desenhado em boucle de 3,5 km que inclui a exigente subida dos degraus do <em>Escad\u00f3rio da N. Sra. dos Rem\u00e9dios<\/em>, prosseguindo por <em>trilhos rurais e caminhos de terra<\/em>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A altimetria apresenta um perfil <em>exigente com 150m de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado por volta<\/em>. A regra de elimina\u00e7\u00e3o obriga a que a 1\u00aa volta seja feita em 33 min, a 2\u00aa em 31 min, a 3\u00aa em 29 min, reduzindo sucessivamente at\u00e9 restar o \u00faltimo atleta em prova. O uso de lanterna frontal \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio para a gest\u00e3o segura da visibilidade noturna.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 5 - ONDE FICAR --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar em <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Lamego<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Para atletas e fam\u00edlias que pretendem pernoitar na regi\u00e3o antes ou depois do <strong>Last Man &#8211; N. S. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026<\/strong>, recomendamos reservas antecipadas em zonas estrat\u00e9gicas de Lamego:<\/p>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Envolvente ao Santu\u00e1rio dos Rem\u00e9dios:<\/strong> Escolha ideal para ficar a escassos metros da zona de secretariado, partida, meta e balne\u00e1rios.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Centro Hist\u00f3rico de Lamego:<\/strong> Excelente variedade de alojamento local e hot\u00e9is com charme junto aos monumentos e restaura\u00e7\u00e3o tradicional.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Eixo R\u00e9gua &#038; Vale do Douro:<\/strong> Op\u00e7\u00e3o c\u00e9nica com vasta oferta tur\u00edstica e r\u00e1pida liga\u00e7\u00e3o rodovi\u00e1ria at\u00e9 \u00e0 cidade de Lamego.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 6 - GASTRONOMIA & ACOMPANHANTES --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia Regional<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A regi\u00e3o de <strong>Lamego<\/strong> oferece um patrim\u00f3nio cultural e paisag\u00edstico rico. Ap\u00f3s o esfor\u00e7o da prova, os participantes podem desfrutar dos sabores locais da gastronomia regional, como <em>B\u00f4la de Lamego, Leit\u00e3o Assado de Lamego e Peixinhos da Horta acompanhados por vinhos da regi\u00e3o do Douro<\/em> em restaurantes t\u00edpicos da localidade.<\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Guia de Acompanhantes &#038; Espectadores<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Os acompanhantes e fam\u00edlias podem assistir \u00e0 prova e apoiar os atletas em locais estrat\u00e9gicos como <strong>Escad\u00f3rio do Santu\u00e1rio de N. Sra. dos Rem\u00e9dios (tro\u00e7o de subida dos degraus) e p\u00f3rtico de meta no arranque das voltas<\/strong>, desfrutando da anima\u00e7\u00e3o e do acolhimento local.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO CROSS-LINKING --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Outras Provas Recomendadas na <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mesma Regi\u00e3o<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Descubra tamb\u00e9m outros eventos desportivos de relevo agendados para a \u00e9poca: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-viseu\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">Corridas em Viseu<\/a> e <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calendario-de-corridas\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">Calend\u00e1rio de Provas de Trail Running e Elimina\u00e7\u00e3o<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 7 - FAQS ALINHADAS COM FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas Frequentes <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">(Last Man &#8211; N. S. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026)<\/span><\/h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do Last Man &#8211; N. S. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento realiza-se no dia <strong>5 de setembro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado)<\/strong>, com partidas agendadas a partir das <strong>18:00 (Secretariado a partir das 16:30)<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se realiza a prova e qual \u00e9 o concelho e distrito?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A partida tem lugar em <strong>Lamego<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias oficiais dispon\u00edveis no Last Man &#8211; N. S. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa oficial disponibiliza as dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>Circuito de 3,5 km (150m D+) em elimina\u00e7\u00f5es progressivas (Last Man Standing)<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Last Man &#8211; N. S. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento \u00e9 assegurada por <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Lamaecus D\u2019Ouro, Irmandade Sra. dos Rem\u00e9dios e Freguesia de Lamego<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados e as fotografias da prova?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais e os tempos oficiais poder\u00e3o ser acedidos na p\u00e1gina da prova no portal <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">Portugal Running<\/a> ap\u00f3s o encerramento do evento. A fotorreportagem e as galerias de imagens poder\u00e3o ser pesquisadas atrav\u00e9s dos canais oficiais da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e nas plataformas parceiras de cobertura fotogr\u00e1fica desportiva.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do Last Man \u2013 N. S. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no dia5 de setembro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado), com partidas agendadas a partir das18:00 (Secretariado a partir das 16:30).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se realiza a prova e qual \u00e9 o concelho e distrito?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida tem lugar emLamego, no distrito deViseu.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias oficiais dispon\u00edveis no Last Man \u2013 N. S. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa oficial disponibiliza as dist\u00e2ncias deCircuito de 3,5 km (150m D+) em elimina\u00e7\u00f5es progressivas (Last Man Standing).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Last Man \u2013 N. S. dos Rem\u00e9dios 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento \u00e9 assegurada porAssocia\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Lamaecus D\u2019Ouro, Irmandade Sra. dos Rem\u00e9dios e Freguesia de Lamego.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Questio